    "insert": "\nThe goal of this study is to develop an interactive AI teaching agent that ensures group collaboration with equal participation of all group members, and evaluating this agent in an experimental setting"
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
